<title>UK: BOE allots 197 mln stg on UK money market repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 197 mln stg on UK money market repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England allotted a total 197 million stg in repurchase and secured loan facilities at six percent for the UK money market.</p>
<p>All 197 million stg was offered by way of the repo facility maturing on March 20, 21 and 24.</p>
<p>The Bank had also offered a five-week repo, maturing on April 10, 11 and 14.</p>
<p>The facility opens on Thursday, Friday and next Monday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
